{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21269","headline":"酬乐天赴江州路上见寄三首 一 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天赴江州路上见寄三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔在京城心，今在吴楚末。\n千山道路险，万里音尘阔。\n天上参与商，地上胡与越。\n终天升沈异，满地网罗设。\n心有无眹环，肠有无绳结。\n有结解不开，有环寻不歇。\n山岳移可尽，江海塞可绝。\n离恨若空虚，穷年思不彻。\n生莫强相同，相同会相别。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21269.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21269","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}